{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07887","headline":"送王昌龄之岭南 · 孟浩然","name":"送王昌龄之岭南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭去远近，枫叶早惊秋。\n岘首羊公爱，长沙贾谊愁。\n土毛无缟紵，乡味有槎头。\n已抱沈痼疾，更贻魑魅忧。\n数年同笔砚，兹夕间衾裯。\n意气今何在，相思望斗牛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}